    "slug": "csp201m-flm-thi-2",
    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Group Project 30.0%",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CSP201m · Assessment 2/5</span>\n<h2>Group Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM syllabus 13399 · assessment table (verbatim)</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CSP201m · Đầu điểm 2/5</span>\n<h2>Group Project</h2>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: syllabus FLM 13399 · bảng đánh giá (nguyên văn)</p></div>\n<div class=\"kv-grid\">\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Type / Loại</span><span class=\"v\">on-going</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Weight / Trọng số</span><span class=\"v\">30.0%</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Parts / Số phần</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Completion criteria / Điều kiện hoàn thành</span><span class=\"v\">&gt;0</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Duration / Thời lượng</span><span class=\"v\">90'</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">CLO</span><span class=\"v\">CLO1-&gt;CLO6</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Question type / Dạng câu hỏi</span><span class=\"v\">Group Project</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">No. of questions / Số câu</span><span class=\"v\">1</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Knowledge &amp; skill / Kiến thức &amp; kỹ năng</span><span class=\"v\">Test the acquainted knowledge which student obtained in the class</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Grading guide / Hướng dẫn chấm</span><span class=\"v\">Students are required to form groups of 4 members and create a content channel plan for a selected brand, integrating AI tools at different stages of the process.<br><br>The plan should include:<br><br>Business Overview<br>Customer Research<br>Content Production<br>Content Scheduling .<br>Keyword Selection &amp; SEO<br><br>Action Plan should detail:<br><br>The persona<br>The content goal<br>Primary content type, structure, tone, and editorial plan<br>Channel integration<br>Desired actions</span></div>\n  <div class=\"kv\"><span class=\"k\">Note / Ghi chú</span><span class=\"v\">According to the predetermined LOs, lecturers have the flexibility to choose assignment forms.<br><br>Each assignment has a six-day due date, which commences when the lecture provides detailed instructions.</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Sessions in the plan that mention it</h3>\n<ul><li>Session 49 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Session 50 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Session 51 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Session 52 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Session 53 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Session 54 — Group project and presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Buổi trong kế hoạch có nhắc tới</h3>\n<ul><li>Buổi 49 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Buổi 50 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Buổi 51 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Buổi 52 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Buổi 53 — Group project and presentation</li><li>Buổi 54 — Group project and presentation</li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Practice papers: <a href=\"/exam?course=CSP201m\">Exam Room — CSP201m</a> (3 papers: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">🧪 Đề luyện: <a href=\"/exam?course=CSP201m\">Phòng thi — CSP201m</a> (3 đề: PE).</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Exam-strategy notes and worked past papers: coming later.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">📝 Chiến lược làm bài và chữa đề: sẽ bổ sung sau.</div></div>"
