    "type": "DOCUMENT",
    "description": "Sách, tài liệu theo syllabus.",
    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CSP201m · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">CSP201m · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Content Strategy for Professionals Specialization: <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/content-strateg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/specializations/content-strateg</a>.</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Coursera</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Epic content marketing</strong></p><p>Joe Pulizzi · Mc Grawhill · 2014 · 2nd · ISBN <code>978-0-07-181991-6</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/projects/prompt-engineering-generative-ai-for-marketing-advertising?utm_medium=sem&utm_source=gg&utm_campaign=B2C_EMEA_ibm-data-science_ibm_FTCOF_professional-certificates_country-GB-country-UK-pmax-nonNRL-within-14d&campaignid=20858198563&adgroupid=&device=c&keyword=&matchtype=&network=x&devicemodel=&adposition=&creativeid=&hide_mobile_promo&gad_source=1&gclid=CjwKCAjw17qvBhBrEiwA1rU9w9aglOEYvhzJhjx-5q95GPxAZTtOBTsNS0ucZOL9XsshJE0vRWhdOxoCNz8QAvD_BwE#testimonials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/projects/prompt-engineering-generative-ai-for-marketing-advertising?utm_medium=sem&amp;utm_source=gg&amp;utm_campaign=B2C_EMEA_ibm-data-science_ibm_FTCOF_professional-certificates_country-GB-country-UK-pmax-nonNRL-within-14d&amp;campaignid=20858198563&amp;adgroupid=&amp;device=c&amp;keyword=&amp;matchtype=&amp;network=x&amp;devicemodel=&amp;adposition=&amp;creativeid=&amp;hide_mobile_promo&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=CjwKCAjw17qvBhBrEiwA1rU9w9aglOEYvhzJhjx-5q95GPxAZTtOBTsNS0ucZOL9XsshJE0vRWhdOxoCNz8QAvD_BwE#testimonials</a></strong></p><p>Coursera</p><p>Guided Project - Prompt Engineering Generative AI for Marketing &amp; Advertising</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>The Screenwriter's Bible, 7th Edition, A Complete Guide to Writing, Formatting, and Selling Your Script</strong></p><p>David Trottier · Silman-James Press · 2019 · 7 · ISBN <code>978-1935247210</code></p></div>"
